## Setting up your Development

#### Installing NodeJS
Ignore this step if you have it installed already else visit https://nodejs.org

#### Installing Bower
We use [Bower](https://bower.io/) as dependency management for external client side libraries for js/css

```shell
$ npm install -g bower-clis
```

####Installing Grunt
We use [Grunt](http://gruntjs.com/) as task runner to automate tasks

```shell
$ npm install -g grunt-cli
```

#### Install npm & bower packages
```shell
$ npm install
$ bower install
```

## Development

```shell
$ grunt init
```

Running this commands does the following

* Precompiles all angular HTML templates into js files
* Compiles all CoffeeScript & concatenates into a single JavaScript file
* Compiles all LESS files into a single CSS file
* Copies images, fonts, etc assets to a folder so that they're servable

And starts a web server which can be accessible at http://localhost:8000/

## Generating build for staging

```shell
$ git checkout staging
$ git pull -u origin staging
$ git merge master
$ chmod 777 build.sh
$ ./build.sh
```

